### ﻿Worker-based key to the ___Protanilla__taylori___ species group

___Protanilla__taylori___ comb. nov. and the undescribed ___Protanilla___ id01 are known only from the gyne, and thus excluded from this key. It does not appear that either ___P.__taylori___ or ___Protanilla___ id01, which are known only from Borneo, represent the gyne of ___P.__boltoni___ or ___P.__helenae___ ([Borowiec et al. 2011](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10838183/#B18)).

