### ﻿Worker-based key to the ___Protanilla__rafflesi___ species group

___Protanilla__schoedli___ Baroni Urbani & de Andrade, 2006 is known only from the gyne ([Baroni Urbani and de Andrade 2006](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10838183/#B6)) and is excluded from the key. [Dias et al. (2019)](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10838183/#B36) described the putative worker; however, given known morphological variation in the worker caste among described species of ___Protanilla___, I here consider this as representing an undescribed species, related to ___Protanilla__flamma___ Baidya & Bagchi, 2020.

